<!--
purpose: Canonical skeleton for the `c4-drift-detection-from-iac` drift report — one section per rule in content/01-core-rules.xml.
consumes: The machine-readable C4 model at a commit, applied IaC state output with its identity, the mapping table, the allowlist, the previous report.
produces: A committed report at .product/c4-drift-detection-from-iac/<system>-<serial>.md plus its JSON form validated by scripts/validate-c4-drift-detection-from-iac.py.
depends-on: templates/header.yaml, content/02-output-contract.xml, scripts/validate-c4-drift-detection-from-iac.py.
token-budget-impact: ~1000 tokens to fill for a report with five findings.
-->
---
version: 0.1.0
system_name: {{ system_name }}
model_commit: {{ model_commit }}
state_identity: {{ state_identity }}
comparison_level: {{ comparison_level }}
run_url: {{ run_url }}
---

# Model and state

- system_name: {{ system_name }}
- c4_model: <structurizr-dsl | structurizr-json | likec4 | model-yaml | model-json> at <path>, commit {{ model_commit }}
- iac_state: <terraform | pulumi | cloudformation>; source <terraform-show-json | pulumi-stack-export | cloudformation-describe-stack-resources>; identity {{ state_identity }}
- comparison_level: {{ comparison_level }} (container | system-context; never component)
- run: trigger <post-apply | schedule>; ran_at <timestamp>; cadence <hourly | daily | weekly>; post_apply_hook_wired true
- escalated: <finding ids open across two consecutive reports, or none>

# Mapping and allowlist

- mapping_table: <path> at commit <sha>
- allowlist: <path> at commit <sha>; hardcoded_skips_in_script false

| Allowlist entry | Suppressed count |
|---|---|
| <resource type or pattern> | <n> |

# Findings

| Id | Class | IaC address | C4 element id | Description | Closure | Reports open |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| drift-NNNN | added \| removed \| edge-changed | <resource address> | <element id or expected:id> | <what differs and where the edge comes from> | model-commit <sha> \| iac-change <sha> \| accepted (<reason>, expires <date>) \| open | <n> |

# Unmapped and reconciliation

| Unmapped resource type | Count |
|---|---|
| <type not in the mapping table> | <n> |

- state_resources_total: <n> = allowlisted <n> + mapped <n> + unmapped <n>

# Evidence

- {{ run_url }}
- <mapping table URL at commit>
- <allowlist URL at commit>
- <previous report URL>
